does not relicense them.

Upstream projects:
  Aider-AI/aider
  QwenLM/qwen-code (includes Google/Gemini-derived Apache-2.0 code)
  continuedev/continue
  openai/codex

Exact source commits and per-file hashes are in packets/*/manifest.json.
No upstream source files have been rewritten. Runtime host adaptations are
separate files under bridges/ and context_packets/. dist/build-manifest.json
records the build input files and explicit import substitutions.

Codex's SpawnAgentArgs::fork_mode behavior is ported into workflow.fork_history;
the complete original handler and its tests remain in the Codex source packet.
The original codex-utils-string Rust library and its unit tests are compiled
directly through rust/Cargo.toml, using an independent dependency lockfile.
